# Add one feed URL per line (APK format, bare URL ending with /packages.adb).
# Entries are prepended to the downloaded ImageBuilder repositories file before `make image`.
#
# Available variables:
#   ${PACKAGES_ARCH}
#   ${OPENWRT_VERSION}
#   ${BIG_VERSION}
#   ${DISTRIB_ARCH}
#   ${DISTRIB_RELEASE}
#
# Review third-party feed availability and signatures before enabling any entries.
#
# Example placeholders to review manually before use:
# https://example.com/releases/packages-${BIG_VERSION}/${PACKAGES_ARCH}/passwall_packages/packages.adb
# https://example.com/releases/packages-${BIG_VERSION}/${PACKAGES_ARCH}/passwall_luci/packages.adb
# https://example.com/packages/${PACKAGES_ARCH}/openwrt_kenzok8/packages.adb
https://mywrt.awayfrom.cn/packages-${BIG_VERSION}/${PACKAGES_ARCH}/mywrt/packages.adb